message: "If you use this software or derived summaries, cite the manuscript and this repository release."
title: "CrackToCause-SBI: simulation-based inference of foundation settlement from crack patterns"
version: "0.1.0-2026-10-21"
date-released: 2026-10-21
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Johnsonlijian/cracktocause-sbi"
url: "https://github.com/Johnsonlijian/cracktocause-sbi"
keywords:
  - simulation-based inference
  - phase-field fracture
  - masonry façade
  - settlement
  - crack patterns
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code and author-generated derived summaries for a phase-field
  fracture simulator coupled to neural posterior estimation of foundation
  settlement from crack maps. Raw campaign data, trained weights, and
  third-party digitized inputs are excluded.
